# EXPECT: broader concept or be the top concept
# A taxonomy concept that has neither a broader concept nor a top-concept link.
@prefix o4de: <http://www.zt4swe.io/o4de#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
o4de:OrphanConcept a skos:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "Orphan"@en ; skos:inScheme o4de:DomainEngineeringTaxonomy .
